      "writtenOn": "2020-07-10T17:10:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is based off of testing a bit. In the first few iterations of the loop, charging isn\u0027t stable/correct so making the calculation then leads to some strange values throwing off the loop even more. However, after those initial iterations it then begins to behave as expected. From there onwards, the resistance values aren\u0027t changing _too_ rapidly. I\u0027ve seen some relationship between current entering the pack and Rbatt.\n\nCurrently, these resistances are just updated periodically with no averaging. Once it\u0027s settled, I haven\u0027t seen large changes.",
