      "writtenOn": "2020-07-10T15:53:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should these be initialized using the configs?  It seems like if the first time we start charging in S0, these will be 0 and we would previously have used the configs in that scenario.  \n\nAnd then after un-plug, I\u0027m guessing we should use whatever was calculated in S5 going forward until next time we\u0027re in S5?  Is that a reasonable lifetime on the values stored?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 21,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "ee587f547a8d9c5faddb3638aed7e4ce5370cac4",
